---
layout: base.njk
title: Passphrases - TofuPass
pageKey: passphrases
extraCss:
  - /assets/css/passphrases.css
pageScripts:
  - /assets/js/wordlists.js
  - /assets/js/passphrases.js
backgroundDecor: leaves
---

  <div class="passphrase-band" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <main id="main-content" class="relative z-10 pt-24 pb-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <section class="passphrase-stage">
        <div class="passphrase-copy">
          <img width="500" height="500" src="/excited.webp" alt="Miso looking excited" class="w-20 h-20 mb-5 mascot-glow" />
          <p class="passphrase-kicker">Readable long secrets</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black mb-4 text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">Passphrases</h1>
          <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-base leading-relaxed max-w-md">Long, lower-friction secrets for places where length is welcome and memorability matters more than meeting fussy symbol rules.</p>
          <div class="passphrase-example" aria-hidden="true">bloom-tiger-leaf-fog</div>
        </div>

        <div class="passphrase-tool" aria-labelledby="passphraseToolTitle">
          <div class="passphrase-tool-head">
            <div>
              <p class="passphrase-kicker">Generator</p>
              <h2 id="passphraseToolTitle" class="text-xl font-black text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">Fresh passphrase</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="passphrase-badge" id="passphraseCountBadge">4 words</span>
          </div>

          <button type="button" id="passphrasePanel" class="passphrase-panel" aria-labelledby="passphraseLabel passphraseDisplay" aria-describedby="passphraseHint">
            <span id="passphraseLabel" class="sr-only">Generated passphrase</span>
            <output id="passphraseDisplay" class="passphrase-display" aria-labelledby="passphraseLabel">Generating...</output>
            <span id="passphraseHint" class="passphrase-hint">Click passphrase to copy</span>
          </button>

          <div class="passphrase-actions">
            <button type="button" id="passphraseGenerate" class="cta-btn passphrase-generate">Generate New Passphrase</button>
          </div>
          <div id="passphraseStatus" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>

          <div class="passphrase-controls" aria-label="Passphrase options">
            <div>
              <div class="control-label" id="passphraseWordsLabel">Words</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="count" role="group" aria-labelledby="passphraseWordsLabel">
                <button type="button" data-count="4" aria-pressed="true">4</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="5" aria-pressed="false">5</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="6" aria-pressed="false">6</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="8" aria-pressed="false">8</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="control-label" id="passphraseSeparatorLabel">Separator</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="separator" role="group" aria-labelledby="passphraseSeparatorLabel">
                <button type="button" data-separator="-" aria-pressed="true">-</button>
                <button type="button" data-separator=" " aria-pressed="false">space</button>
                <button type="button" data-separator="." aria-pressed="false">.</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="control-label" id="passphraseCaseLabel">Case</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="case" role="group" aria-labelledby="passphraseCaseLabel">
                <button type="button" data-case="lower" aria-pressed="true">lower</button>
                <button type="button" data-case="title" aria-pressed="false">Title</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="passphrase-notes" aria-label="Passphrase guidance">
        <div class="note-strip note-strip-green">
          <div class="note-icon ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2>Use passphrases when length is allowed.</h2>
            <p>They shine for vault master passwords, Wi-Fi passwords, device passcodes, recovery phrases you need to type by hand, and any place that accepts spaces or separators.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="note-strip note-strip-yellow">
          <div class="note-icon ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.2 8.4-7 10-3.8-1.6-7-5-7-10V6l7-3z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2>Use Firm or Extra Firm for picky forms.</h2>
            <p>When a site demands capitals, a symbol, and numbers, the main generator keeps those requirements built into every Soft, Firm, and Extra Firm password.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
